tom: 0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\\\"><span style=\\\"\\\">·<span style=\\\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>Ensure each service can\\noperate independently and scale as needed.<br><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\">3.<span style=\\\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\\/span><\\/span><b>Deployment and Management<\\/b>:<br><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\\\"><span style=\\\"\\\">·<span style=\\\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>Use containerization (e.g.,\\nDocker) and orchestration tools (e.g., Kubernetes) to deploy and manage\\nmicroservices.<br><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\\\"><span style=\\\"\\\">·<span style=\\\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span>Implement CI/CD pipelines\\nfor automated testing, deployment, and updates.<br><\\/p><div><br><\\/div>\",\"leadTime\":\"358260000\",\"sharedItemCount\":0,\"addedVia\":0,\"hasCheckList\":false,\"UDF_CHKBOX2\":\"\",\"duration\":\"23d\",\"UDF_CHKBOX1\":\"120216000000420553\",\"diffDays\":\"1h 6m\",\"statusName\":\"Done\",\"totalWorkhours\":\"0\",\"isDocsAdded\":false,\"UDF_FORMULASTR1\":\"7/2024\",\"UDF_RADIO1\":\"\",\"UDF_DATE1\":\"-1\",\"baseItemType\":2,\"UDF_EMAIL1\":\"\",\"depth\":\"0\",\"createdBy\":\"120216000000010017\",\"UDF_MULTIUSERPKL1\":[\"120216000000175003\"],\"UDF_ROLLUP10\":\"25d 4h\",\"tagCount\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"completedBy\":\"12021600